@startuml
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam Shadowing false
title Exporting attendance without replacing an existing file
start
:Parse destination and optional group;
if (Arguments valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Report a parsing error;
    stop
endif
if (Requested group is registered or no group supplied?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Report an unknown group;\nPreserve the current view;
    stop
endif
:Resolve destination inside the JAR home;\nReject child symbolic links and missing parent folders;
if (Destination is valid and does not exist?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Report a file error;\nPreserve any existing destination;
    stop
endif
:Select students from the full roster;\nSort by matriculation number;
:Create a temporary sibling file;\nWrite the UTF-8 header and attendance rows;\nClose the writer;
note right
  Sessions are ordered by teaching week.
  No sessions: one row with empty session fields.
  No students: header only.
end note
:Move the completed file to the destination\nwithout replacing an existing file;
if (Writing and publishing succeeded?) then (yes)
    :Remove the temporary file if it remains;
    :Return student and row counts;
else (no)
    :Remove the temporary file if created;
    :Report the I/O error;
endif
note right
  Roster records and the displayed view are unchanged.
  An I/O error during temporary-file creation,
  writing or publishing follows the failure path.
end note
stop
@enduml
